<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
    <name>HSK 贸易重构</name>
    <author>local</author>
    <packageId>local.imperialcoin</packageId>
    <supportedVersions>
        <li>1.6</li>
    </supportedVersions>
    <description>帝国银币货币: 把游戏货币改为帝国银令(SilverCoin)。货币只能通过贸易获得, 不能自产; 商人商品中不再出售货币; 银矿(Silver)回归纯材料, 与货币完全分离(1 银矿 = 1 银令); 帝国金令(GoldCoin)作为高面值货币(1 金令 = 10 银令), 工业时代以上商队与轨道商人固定携带; 交易支付时银令不足会自动用金令整枚折算补足(多不退少不补); 帝国与金鼠族贡品收集者以金令收购替代金矿收购。科技差距贸易溢价: 购买武器/CE弹药/衣物时, 按物品科技等级与玩家科技等级的差距加价 10^n 倍(最高 1000 倍), 只影响购买不影响出售(玩家科技等级随 TechAdvancing 动态提升)。</description>
    <modDependencies>
        <li>
            <packageId>brrainz.harmony</packageId>
            <displayName>Harmony</displayName>
            <downloadUrl>https://github.com/pardeike/HarmonyRimWorld/releases/latest</downloadUrl>
        </li>
        <li>
            <packageId>CETeam.CombatExtended</packageId>
            <displayName>Combat Extended</displayName>
            <downloadUrl>https://github.com/CombatExtended-Continued/CombatExtended/releases/latest</downloadUrl>
        </li>
        <li>
            <packageId>skyarkhangel.HSK</packageId>
            <displayName>Core SK</displayName>
            <downloadUrl>https://github.com/skyarkhangel/Hardcore-SK</downloadUrl>
        </li>
        <li>
            <packageId>DimonSever000.ModIndicator.Specific</packageId>
            <displayName>HSK Autosort and Mod Assistant</displayName>
            <downloadUrl>https://rimworld.example/DimonSever000.ModIndicator.Specific</downloadUrl>
			</li>
    </modDependencies>
    <loadAfter>
        <li>brrainz.harmony</li>
        <li>CETeam.CombatExtended</li>
        <li>skyarkhangel.HSK</li>
        <li>ratkinpatch.HSKIndustrialResearchOverhaul</li>
        <li>local.ratkin.clothesweapons</li>
        <li>local.ratkin.goldenhsk</li>
        <li>DimonSever000.ModIndicator.Specific</li>
    </loadAfter>
</ModMetaData>
